---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Contact GEAR Moto Foundation for partnerships, events, volunteering, rider education and general inquiries.">
<section class="inner-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Let's Connect</div><h1>GET IN TOUCH.<br/><span class="accent">GET IN GEAR.</span></h1><p class="lede" style="color:#e5e8eb">Questions, ideas, or an opportunity to make a difference? We'd like to hear from you.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="department-intro"><span class="section-label">CONTACT THE RIGHT TEAM</span><h2>WHERE SHOULD YOUR MESSAGE GO?</h2><p>Choose the right department for a faster, more relevant response. Each link opens your email application with the recipient and subject ready.</p></div><div class="department-grid"><a class="department-card" href="mailto:partner@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Partnership%20Inquiry"><span>PARTNERSHIPS</span><h3>Partners &amp; Sponsors</h3><p>Corporate sponsorships, community partners, event hosts and collaborative opportunities.</p><strong>partner@gearmotofoundation.org ↗</strong></a><a class="department-card" href="mailto:assistance@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Assistance%20Inquiry"><span>RIDER SUPPORT</span><h3>Assistance &amp; Resources</h3><p>Questions about rider support, available resources and our developing Assistance program. No applications are open yet.</p><strong>assistance@gearmotofoundation.org ↗</strong></a><a class="department-card" href="mailto:info@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Foundation%20Inquiry"><span>01 / FOUNDATION</span><h3>Programs &amp; General</h3><p>Rider programs, volunteering, events, media, partnerships, and foundation questions.</p><strong>info@gearmotofoundation.org ↗</strong></a><a class="department-card" href="mailto:shop@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Shop%20Inquiry"><span>02 / MERCHANDISE</span><h3>Shop GEAR</h3><p>Merchandise designs, sizing, future orders, wholesale and shop partnerships.</p><strong>shop@gearmotofoundation.org ↗</strong></a><a class="department-card" href="mailto:donate@gearmotofoundation.org?subject=GEAR%20Giving%20Inquiry"><span>03 / GIVING</span><h3>Donors &amp; Giving</h3><p>Future giving opportunities, donor relations and fundraising inquiries. Online donations are not open yet.</p><strong>donate@gearmotofoundation.org ↗</strong></a></div></div><div class="wrap contact-layout">
  <div class="contact-panel">
    <div class="eyebrow accent">Send a Message</div><h2>Start a Conversation.</h2>
    <p>Complete the form and our team will follow up as we're able. Fields marked * are required.</p>
    <form id="gear-contact-form" class="gear-contact-form" method="post" action="/api/contact" novalidate>
      <div class="contact-fields">
        <div class="contact-field"><label for="contact-name">Full Name *</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required /></div>
        <div class="contact-field"><label for="contact-email">Email Address *</label><input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required /></div>
        <div class="contact-field"><label for="contact-phone">Phone (optional)</label><input id="contact-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="40" /></div>
        <div class="contact-field"><label for="contact-topic">How Can We Help? *</label><select id="contact-topic" name="topic" required><option value="">Choose a topic</option><option value="General inquiry">General Inquiry</option><option value="Corporate sponsorship">Corporate Sponsorship</option><option value="Community partnership">Community Partnership</option><option value="Events">Events &amp; Hosting</option><option value="Volunteering">Volunteering</option><option value="Gear and education">Gear &amp; Rider Education</option><option value="Program information">Program Information</option><option value="Assistance inquiry">Assistance &amp; Rider Resources</option><option value="Media">Media Inquiry</option><option value="Shop inquiry">Shop &amp; Merchandise</option><option value="Giving inquiry">Giving &amp; Donations</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-field"><label for="contact-message">Your Message *</label><textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="6" minlength="10" maxlength="4000" required placeholder="Tell us a little about what you'd like to discuss."></textarea></div>
      <div class="form-honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="contact-website">Leave this field blank</label><input id="contact-website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></div>
      <p class="contact-privacy"><strong>Privacy:</strong> Please don't include medical records, accident reports, account numbers or other sensitive personal information. Rider assistance applications are not yet open.</p>
      <button class="btn btn-red contact-submit" type="submit">Send Message <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
      <p id="contact-feedback" class="contact-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
  <aside class="contact-side"><div class="eyebrow">Direct Contact</div><h2>Let's Build a Stronger Riding Community.</h2><p>We're developing partnerships, community events and programs supporting riders across all four GEAR pillars.</p><div class="contact-email-block"><span>Rider Assistance</span><a href="mailto:assistance@gearmotofoundation.org">assistance@gearmotofoundation.org</a></div><div class="contact-email-block"><span>Foundation &amp; Programs</span><a href="mailto:info@gearmotofoundation.org">info@gearmotofoundation.org</a></div><div class="contact-email-block"><span>Partners &amp; Sponsors</span><a href="mailto:partner@gearmotofoundation.org">partner@gearmotofoundation.org</a></div><div class="contact-email-block"><span>Shop &amp; Merchandise</span><a href="mailto:shop@gearmotofoundation.org">shop@gearmotofoundation.org</a></div><div class="contact-email-block"><span>Giving &amp; Donor Inquiries</span><a href="mailto:donate@gearmotofoundation.org">donate@gearmotofoundation.org</a></div><hr/><h3>All Bikes. All Riders.</h3><p>Gear. Education. Assistance. Recovery.</p><p class="contact-aside-note">Illustrative programs and partnership opportunities are in development. We cannot accept or process assistance applications through this contact form.</p></aside>
</div></section>
<script is:inline>
  (() => {
    const form = document.getElementById('gear-contact-form');
    const feedback = document.getElementById('contact-feedback');
    const topic = document.getElementById('contact-topic');
    const departmentAddress = () => ['Corporate sponsorship','Community partnership'].includes(topic?.value) ? 'partner@gearmotofoundation.org' : topic?.value === 'Assistance inquiry' ? 'assistance@gearmotofoundation.org' : topic?.value === 'Shop inquiry' ? 'shop@gearmotofoundation.org' : topic?.value === 'Giving inquiry' ? 'donate@gearmotofoundation.org' : 'info@gearmotofoundation.org';
    if (!form || !feedback) return;
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (!form.reportValidity()) return;
      const button = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
      button.disabled = true;
      feedback.textContent = 'Sending your message…';
      feedback.dataset.state = '';
      try {
        const response = await fetch(form.action, {method:'POST', body: new FormData(form), headers:{'Accept':'application/json'}});
        const payload = await response.json().catch(() => ({}));
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error(payload.error || 'Your message could not be sent. Please try again.');
        feedback.textContent = 'Thank you. Your message has been sent to GEAR Moto Foundation.';
        feedback.dataset.state = 'success';
        form.reset();
      } catch (error) {
        feedback.textContent = (error instanceof Error ? error.message : 'Unable to send your message.') + ' Please email ' + departmentAddress() + ' directly.';
        feedback.dataset.state = 'error';
      } finally {button.disabled = false;}
    });
  })();
</script>
</Base>